t parties are leading the polls in Germany and France. Would they moderate =
once in power=3F Not necessarily. In Poland and Hungary, hard-right populis=
t governments meaningfully chipped away at the rule of law.</span></p><p st=
yle=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><spa=
n>But one intriguing counterexample is Giorgia Meloni. Italy=E2=80=99s prim=
