to Mozambique, in fields including energy, water, health and agriculture. I=
n Algeria alone, close to 90,000 acres of desert were planted with corn.</s=
pan></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0=
 0 15px"><span>The idea has been not only to encourage would-be migrants to=
