x"><span>Meloni=E2=80=99s impact on E.U. policy in this area has been signi=
ficant, an example of Italy having =E2=80=9Cforce, weight and capacity,=E2=
=80=9D as she put it.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,s=
erif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>That does not stop her using immigra=
