tories and to look after Europe=E2=80=99s oldest population. For Meloni, id=
eology is malleable, often ceding to realism.</span></p><p style=3D"font:no=
rmal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>With Preside=
nt Trump, an ideological ally, she thought this flexibility would pay divid=
